{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15774","headline":"送王尊师归湖州 · 司空曙","name":"送王尊师归湖州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烟芜满洞青山遶，幢节飘空紫凤飞。\n金阙乍看迎日丽，玉箫遥听隔花微。\n多开石髓供调膳，时御霓裳奉易衣。\n莫学辽东华表上，千年始欲一回归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15774.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15774","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}